  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> is a complex number of unit modulus and argument&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math>, then arg <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;can be equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>given</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>"
  },
